    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "閉店後。琥珀は試聴展示に使う片方のイヤホンを探して、薄暗い倉庫へ入っていった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "春日原 琥珀",
      "text": "［01/25 澄まし］旦那、棚卸しはこっちから片づけるぞ。重い箱はオレに任せな。",
      "expressionId": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "澄まし",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ae",
          "src": "images/assets/char/ae_kohaku/standing/ae_kohaku_expression_01_composed.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "zIndex": 2500,
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "春日原 琥珀",
      "text": "［02/25 やさしい微笑み］さっきの接客、ちゃんと見てたぜ。お客さん、いい音だって笑ってたな。",
      "expressionId": "02",
      "expressionLabel": "やさしい微笑み",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ae",
          "src": "images/assets/char/ae_kohaku/standing/ae_kohaku_expression_02_gentle_smile.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "zIndex": 2500,
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "春日原 琥珀",
      "text": "［03/25 笑顔］へへっ、あのスピーカーの調整は大成功！　音が決まると気持ちいいよな。",
      "expressionId": "03",
      "expressionLabel": "笑顔",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ae",
          "src": "images/assets/char/ae_kohaku/standing/ae_kohaku_expression_03_smile.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "zIndex": 2500,
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "春日原 琥珀",
      "text": "［04/25 怒り］……って、試聴用イヤホンが片方ないぞ。備品を雑に扱ったやつ、誰だ？",
      "expressionId": "04",
      "expressionLabel": "怒り",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ae",
          "src": "images/assets/char/ae_kohaku/standing/ae_kohaku_expression_04_anger.webp",
          "side": "center",
          "left": "50%",
          "zIndex": 2500,
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "春日原 琥珀",
      "text": "［05/25 軽い嫌悪］このケーブルの絡まり方、見てるだけでむずむずする。あとで全部直すぞ。",
      "expressionId": "05",
      "expressionLabel": "軽い嫌悪",
      "storySprites": [
        {
